SUCCESS for gemini-3.1-pro-preview -> "Here are a few ways to say "Please visit our store" in Hindi, depending on how formal you want to be:

**Standard and Polite (Most Common):**
कृपया हमारी दुकान पर आएं।
*(Kripaya hamari dukaan par aayen.)*

**Very Polite and Welcoming (Good for customer service):**
कृपया हमारी दुकान में पधारें। 
*(Kripaya hamari dukaan mein padharen.)*

**Modern/Urban (Using the English word "store"):**
कृपया हमारे स्टोर पर आएं।
*(Kripaya hamare store par aayen.)* 

*Note: "दुकान" (Dukaan) means shop/store.*"
